{"reviewId": "76458513_86qGgfqV9", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "为什么经济慢了，能耗却“刹不住车”？ 🏗️\n正如你说的，即便订单减少了 50%，工厂通常也无法减少 50% 的用电量。原因主要有三点：\n1. 维持性负荷：即便只有一台机器在开工，整个车间的照明、空调、安防监控、以及大型设备的预热和维护都得开着。这些是“基础电费”，不随产出减少而立刻消失。\n2. 设备惯性：重型工业（比如炼钢、化工）的锅炉和反应堆一旦停火，重新启动的成本极高。所以即便经济不好，它们也会维持在低效运转状态，继续烧煤烧电。\n3. 结构调整慢：社会整体的能源结构（比如依赖煤炭还是电力）是多年形成的。当经济危机来临时，人们没法一夜之间把费油的老爷车全换成省油的新车。", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "14001-14022", "abstract": "耗能产业和消费结构难以因价格变化而急速转换", "type": 1, "onlyVisibleOneBook": 1, "chapterUid": 6, "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "76458513_86qGgfqV9", "userVid": 76458513, "topics": [], "createTime": 1769366056, "flag": 1073741824, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 76458513, "name": "72772", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/PiajxSqBRaEJoI5r8lWXg5Oc94ohC2BZLezuYcEVt7YSKIFVyrDpsemIV9gz5eAPEnVOdEGTqNTGJhs0J5bTJsn953Av765ibHrIJ3ZMcSfSlnvrjMhzJJww/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M15-1-0", "desc": "21天阅读挑战", "title": "21天阅读挑战", "levelIndex": 0}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 22, "likes": [{"userVid": 361946138, "name": "平常心", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/hNWCQ9bibbzGoH9XyDpnz0KJDHFLBB83KtOloeO7bA0159cFTicmGZEA/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-200", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数", "levelIndex": 200}}